---
model: vertex-ai/gemini-1.5-pro
input:
  schema:
    type: object
    properties:
      customer_name:
        type: string
        description: The name of the customer, including titles, even with commas
      issue_category:
        type: string
        enum: [billing, technical, account, other]
        description: The category that best fits the user's issue
      urgency:
        type: integer
        minimum: 1
        maximum: 5
        description: "Urgency level from 1 (low) to 5 (critical)"
      history:
        type: array
        items:
          type: object
          properties:
            date: { type: string }
            resolved: { type: boolean }
    required: [customer_name, issue_category]
---
# Customer Support Script

Hello {{customer_name}},

I understand you're experiencing a {{issue_category}} issue today.
I've noted that the urgency level for this {{issue_category}} request is set to {{urgency}}.

## Previous Interactions
{{#each history}}
- Date: {{date}}, Resolved: {{resolved}}
{{/each}}

How can I assist you further with your {{issue_category}} request today?
